### VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP client file. Run requests one at a time.
@base = http://localhost:5080
@studentId = PASTE-A-STUDENT-ID
@equipmentId = PASTE-AN-EQUIPMENT-ID
@borrowingId = PASTE-A-BORROWING-ID

### API-01 list equipment / only available
GET {{base}}/api/v1/equipment
###
GET {{base}}/api/v1/equipment?available=true
### API-02 students (search optional)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/students?search=ada
### API-03
GET {{base}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}
### API-04
POST {{base}}/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentNumber": "ST-500", "fullName": "Eli Tan", "contact": null }
### API-05
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentNumber": "ST-500", "fullName": "Eli Tan Jr.", "contact": "eli@example.test" }
### API-06
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}/eligibility
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isEligible": false }
### API-07
GET {{base}}/api/v1/equipment/{{equipmentId}}
### API-08
POST {{base}}/api/v1/equipment
Content-Type: application/json

{ "equipmentCode": "EQ-008", "name": "Charger", "description": null }
### API-09
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/equipment/{{equipmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "equipmentCode": "EQ-008", "name": "Fast charger", "description": "65W" }
### API-10 single issue
POST {{base}}/api/v1/borrowings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": "{{studentId}}", "equipmentId": "{{equipmentId}}", "expectedReturnDate": "2026-11-12" }
### API-11 atomic multi-item checkout
POST {{base}}/api/v1/checkout-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": "{{studentId}}", "equipmentIds": ["PASTE-ID-1", "PASTE-ID-2"], "expectedReturnDate": "2026-11-12" }
### API-12 return
POST {{base}}/api/v1/borrowings/{{borrowingId}}/return
Content-Type: application/json

{}
### API-13
GET {{base}}/api/v1/borrowings/{{borrowingId}}
### API-14
GET {{base}}/api/v1/borrowings?search=cruz&status=Active&sort=expectedReturnDate&direction=desc
### API-15
GET {{base}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}/borrowings
### API-16
GET {{base}}/api/v1/equipment/{{equipmentId}}/borrowings
### OpenAPI
GET {{base}}/openapi/v1.json
### Health (does not touch the database)
GET {{base}}/health
### Dev helpers (only with Dev__Enabled=true)
POST {{base}}/dev/reset
###
POST {{base}}/dev/fault?armed=true
